The files in this directory (knncuda-fastdec/) are an adaptation of kNN-CUDA
by Vincent Garcia, Éric Debreuve and Michel Barlaud:
https://github.com/vincentfpgarcia/kNN-CUDA

Changes from the original: the global-memory kNN implementation was extended
with tiled/batched processing for large datasets, alternative top-k selection
kernels, and an integration layer (KnnCudaFastDEC) for the FastDEC pipeline.

This adaptation is distributed under the same license as the original work,
reproduced below. It is excluded from the MIT license that covers the rest of
this project, and it is only compiled when building with `make USE_KNNCUDA=1`.

